{"4676670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Challenge 99", "steam_appid": 4676670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4844780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 99 is a precision platformer where your goal is to guide a nanoball through increasingly difficult levels in an attempt to escape a simulation. I made this game to test your perseverance and to push your ability to overcome seemingly impossible obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can make it to the end of the game, you can definitely call yourself a master platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What the game offers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >99 unique and creative level designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different abilities to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A practice mode that will help you prepare for the upcoming obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A race mode where you earn ranks by beating fast time goals (with a ghost feature).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough to earn in-game achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden easter eggs and secret collectibles that invite some exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Credits:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AudioCoffee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberwave-Orchestra</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evgeny_Bardyuzha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >mariokhol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PaulYudin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge 99 is a precision platformer where your goal is to